lysis=false -mllvm -enable-emscripten-sjlj -mllvm -disable-lsr --sysroot=D:\\CustomGodot\\emsdk\\upstream\\emscripten\\cache\\sysroot -DEMSCRIPTEN -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -Xclang -iwithsysroot/include\\fakesdl -Xclang -iwithsysroot/include\\compat -Os platform\\javascript\\audio_driver_javascript.javascript.opt.bc -c -o C:\\Users\\user\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\emscripten_temp_m6kam64x\\audio_driver_javascript.javascript.opt_0.o' failed (returned 1)\nscons: *** [bin\\godot.javascript.opt.js] Error 1\nscons: building terminated because of errors.```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585800755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585831989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101034#issuecomment-2585831989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101034","id":2585831989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aIKo1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-12T16:52:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-12T16:53:09Z","body":"Neither 3.2 nor 3.4 are supported anymore, but they should still build fine if you use toolchains from around the time they were supported. I would recommend using Emscripten versions matching the one used by official builds at the time.\n\n- 3.2: Emscripten 1.38.47-upstream: https://github.com/godotengine/build-containers/blob/3.2/Dockerfile.javascript#L12-L13\n- 3.4: Emscripten 2.0.25: https://github.com/godotengine/build-containers/blob/3.4/Dockerfile.javascript#L6\n\nEmscripten breaks compatibility frequently so it's sadly not possible to make sure old Godot branches stay compatible with current Emscripten versions.\n\n>  I’m trying to compile 3.4 cause I found a module on GitHub it is for 3.4\n\nIt's very likely that a module made for 3.4 would work with 3.6, so I would suggest trying that first before an unsupported version of Godot.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585831989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585832894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101034#issuecomment-2585832894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101034","id":2585832894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aIK2-","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/